        "original_id": "92d47225-f45e-549b-b987-6ce9df058846",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aadesh Shrivastava, Shankar Mahadevan, Pritam, Himesh Reshammiya, Abhijeet Bhattacharya, Alka Yagnik, Lalit Pandit, Jatin Pandit\n- Products: Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Challenge 2009, STAR Voice of India\n- Roles: mentors, judges\n\nFacts:\n- In Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Challenge 2009, Aadesh Shrivastava, Shankar Mahadevan, and Pritam were new mentors.\n- In Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Challenge 2009, Himesh Reshammiya joined the show after serving as a judge in the previous edition.\n- In STAR Voice of India, the judges included Aadesh Shrivastava, Abhijeet Bhattacharya, Alka Yagnik, Lalit Pandit, and Jatin Pandit.\n- Aadesh Shrivastava died of cancer at Kokilaben Hospital one day after turning 51.",
